WEBVTT

01:24.920 --> 01:27.320
ADAPTED FROM
THE LEGEND OF KUNSHAN JADE BY TAN TIANYIN

01:38.040 --> 01:39.720
Mr. Yan. Ms. Su.

01:40.240 --> 01:41.080
It's a pity.

01:41.160 --> 01:43.280
Your beryl stones stone is beautiful.

01:43.360 --> 01:44.760
But no design is worth mentioning

01:44.840 --> 01:47.280
in front of a Se of this quality.

01:47.360 --> 01:50.560
It's nature's design. It's unparalleled.

01:50.640 --> 01:52.080
Ms. Su.

01:52.680 --> 01:53.920
I'll work with you.

01:56.840 --> 01:59.200
Clear Mind's designs

01:59.280 --> 02:00.680
are best in Yangzhou.

02:01.440 --> 02:02.520
I'll keep that in mind.

02:02.600 --> 02:04.680
Thank you, Mr. Kang.

02:05.280 --> 02:08.199
Clear Mind will do its best.

02:21.880 --> 02:23.680
The beryl stones stone he showed us…

02:23.760 --> 02:26.120
It was the one
that the Black Dragon Bandits robbed

02:26.200 --> 02:28.080
from the Yan's Trading Convoy.

02:29.200 --> 02:30.680
It's the only one in the world.

02:31.560 --> 02:32.720
It was supposed to be sent to the palace.

02:32.800 --> 02:36.360
But Cui Shijiu tore it apart.

02:36.440 --> 02:37.680
It's a waste of treasure.

02:37.760 --> 02:40.000
The Zheng family
started selling the stolen goods.

02:41.520 --> 02:44.240
Even if they use the stolen goods,

02:44.320 --> 02:45.320
they can't fill Mr. Kang's order.

02:45.920 --> 02:48.720
Zheng Shiyuan will buy beryl stones

02:48.800 --> 02:50.160
from other shops in the guild.

02:51.280 --> 02:52.720
In that case,

02:52.800 --> 02:55.800
the beryl stones you bought
at a high price are useless.

02:59.480 --> 03:01.480
We've been pressing it for a long time.

03:02.000 --> 03:03.200
It's time.

03:08.160 --> 03:09.240
Let's do it

03:11.200 --> 03:12.440
in the name of Clear Mind.

03:13.720 --> 03:14.560
What do you want to do?

03:21.920 --> 03:23.760
All you care about is making money.

03:23.840 --> 03:25.560
You're so greedy.

03:28.880 --> 03:31.080
Now that you're making money,

03:31.160 --> 03:32.600
you pay for this.

03:34.200 --> 03:35.280
Sir, is it ready?

03:35.360 --> 03:37.680
-Yeah.
-Miss Su, here's your wonton.

03:37.760 --> 03:38.600
Thank you.

03:40.560 --> 03:41.520
Have a taste.

03:44.480 --> 03:46.280
He called you Miss Su.

03:48.040 --> 03:50.440
Have you been here a lot?

03:55.360 --> 03:58.320
When I first arrived in Yangzhou,
I often came here.

04:01.320 --> 04:03.880
At that time, you…

04:08.200 --> 04:09.400
I always thought

04:11.840 --> 04:13.240
the living were more important.

04:16.240 --> 04:17.640
Just like the road ahead

04:19.440 --> 04:20.800
is more important than the road you came.

04:26.080 --> 04:29.240
Maybe your eight years on the pearl farm

04:29.960 --> 04:31.560
made you yearn for freedom

04:32.200 --> 04:33.840
and a big world.

04:34.960 --> 04:36.760
It also makes you who you are now.

04:43.680 --> 04:44.680
Maybe.

04:49.600 --> 04:50.480
Is it delicious?

04:54.120 --> 04:54.960
It's okay.

05:14.520 --> 05:15.680
Mr. Kang.

05:27.320 --> 05:29.640
Zijing. My good friend.

05:30.360 --> 05:31.720
Thank you for this time.

05:31.800 --> 05:33.680
-Have a seat. Let's drink.
-Have a seat.

05:36.880 --> 05:37.920
Cheers.

05:40.800 --> 05:42.880
About beryl stones,

05:42.960 --> 05:45.360
thank you for your help. Here's to you.

05:51.600 --> 05:54.440
I'm a businessman.
I won't miss any opportunity

05:54.520 --> 05:56.120
to make money.

05:56.200 --> 05:58.360
There have always been wars
in the Western Regions.

05:58.440 --> 05:59.800
I can't get the goods out.

05:59.880 --> 06:02.400
Besides, I do need beryl stones.

06:03.000 --> 06:05.360
Zijing. Why did you do this?

06:06.120 --> 06:09.560
The price of beryl stones
in Yangzhou has risen.

06:10.200 --> 06:11.480
You should have lost a lot of money.

06:12.080 --> 06:13.360
Yes.

06:14.000 --> 06:16.560
But my purpose is different from yours.

06:22.040 --> 06:24.880
Are you against the Zheng family?

06:28.160 --> 06:29.600
Not only that,

06:30.120 --> 06:31.720
but I want to suppress

06:32.440 --> 06:33.640
and destroy the Zheng family.

06:39.240 --> 06:43.360
Is Ms. Su of Clear Mind also involved?

06:43.440 --> 06:46.240
She offered to be a part of it.

06:46.320 --> 06:48.280
This will make the Zheng family
more convinced.

06:49.680 --> 06:52.800
You must have something to do with Ms. Su.

07:00.920 --> 07:02.240
The relationship between us

07:05.240 --> 07:06.240
is complicated.

07:07.000 --> 07:10.320
Zijing, I've known you for so many years.

07:10.400 --> 07:11.400
It's the first time
I've seen you like this.

07:13.760 --> 07:14.760
Please don't laugh at me.

07:16.000 --> 07:17.680
Forget it. Let's drink.

07:17.760 --> 07:18.680
Cheers.

07:18.760 --> 07:20.440
-Let's drink it away.
-Okay.

07:24.720 --> 07:28.000
I want to thank you again for your help.

07:28.080 --> 07:29.160
I'll remember it.

07:29.240 --> 07:30.720
We are friends.

07:31.360 --> 07:34.760
We helped each other
when we did business in the West Regions.

07:34.840 --> 07:37.800
We broke out from the pack.

07:37.880 --> 07:39.480
That's how we got to where we are today.

07:40.840 --> 07:42.920
We helped each other.

07:43.840 --> 07:46.200
When you come back to Kang,

07:47.080 --> 07:50.640
I'll treat you with nice wine and food.

07:51.240 --> 07:52.680
-That's a deal.
-Cheers.

07:58.000 --> 07:59.360
-Let's eat.
-Come.

07:59.440 --> 08:02.480
Father, Cui Shijiu closed the deal.

08:04.880 --> 08:07.920
We wanted to stall with Kang Ming
to discuss the price.

08:08.000 --> 08:09.920
Unexpectedly, Su Muzhe
suddenly jumped into the deal.

08:10.000 --> 08:11.680
We could only close the deal.

08:13.960 --> 08:15.200
It's Clear Mind again.

08:15.280 --> 08:18.960
She sells shattered glass.
Isn't she self-aware?

08:22.040 --> 08:23.040
Never mind.

08:24.480 --> 08:26.840
We want a long-term collaboration
with Kang Ming.

08:28.920 --> 08:29.760
Well…

08:30.360 --> 08:32.679
How's Cui Shijiu doing with the jewelry?

08:32.760 --> 08:35.840
We've broken up all the goods.
We only have three Hus of beryl stones.

08:37.159 --> 08:38.760
It can't fill

08:38.840 --> 08:39.720
Kang Ming's order.

08:40.600 --> 08:44.240
Its price is too high in the market.

08:45.960 --> 08:46.800
What do you think we should do?

08:46.880 --> 08:48.760
There are many merchants
in the Yangzhou Jewelry Guild.

08:48.840 --> 08:51.120
They must have hoarded beryl stones.

08:51.200 --> 08:53.720
Let's buy it at the original price.

08:55.720 --> 08:56.760
You have made progress.

08:58.000 --> 09:00.360
I'm worried that they're greedy

09:00.440 --> 09:03.120
and won't sell it
as they see that it's profitable.

09:03.200 --> 09:06.560
Father, you have to do it yourself.

09:08.400 --> 09:10.640
I should teach them a lesson.

09:10.720 --> 09:12.360
Otherwise,

09:12.440 --> 09:15.560
they will forget
who the Yangzhou Jewelry Guild belongs to.

09:17.000 --> 09:18.560
Arrange for the signing of the contract
as soon as possible.

09:18.640 --> 09:21.400
We'll be safe after we sell those goods.

09:21.920 --> 09:22.760
Yes, Father.

09:22.840 --> 09:25.600
After completing the business
with Kang Ming,

09:26.560 --> 09:29.760
remember to get rid of Cui Shijiu.

09:37.400 --> 09:39.560
Father, the business…

09:39.640 --> 09:41.360
Shijiu closed it.

09:41.440 --> 09:45.000
She made a contribution to us.

09:47.000 --> 09:48.800
Since she closed it,

09:49.560 --> 09:51.480
give her a dignified death.

10:11.600 --> 10:12.440
Mother.

10:24.760 --> 10:25.880
Are you feeling better?

10:32.280 --> 10:34.320
I'm here every day

10:35.920 --> 10:37.440
waiting for you to come back.

10:45.320 --> 10:46.160
Mother.

10:47.880 --> 10:50.320
Shijiu didn't mean it.

10:57.760 --> 10:58.880
Do you like her

11:00.800 --> 11:02.280
that much?

11:12.840 --> 11:13.800
Mother.

11:14.840 --> 11:16.320
I never really loved a woman

11:17.000 --> 11:19.680
growing up.

11:20.200 --> 11:24.160
I never asked you for anything growing up.

11:24.240 --> 11:25.680
I beg you

11:27.120 --> 11:28.200
to allow me

11:29.000 --> 11:31.520
to stay with Cui Shijiu
for the rest of my life.

11:35.120 --> 11:35.960
Mother.

11:38.680 --> 11:40.360
This is not my home.

11:42.440 --> 11:44.000
It isn't your home, either.

11:44.800 --> 11:46.720
The fame and fortune
of Yangzhou Jewelry Guild

11:46.800 --> 11:48.720
are not what I want.

11:48.800 --> 11:50.200
I want to take you

11:51.200 --> 11:53.360
to live a safe and secure life.

11:53.960 --> 11:55.720
When I finish this,

11:56.280 --> 11:58.120
everything will be different.

12:02.120 --> 12:05.000
Wherever you are,

12:05.960 --> 12:07.560
that's my home.

12:09.000 --> 12:10.320
I will

12:11.160 --> 12:14.440
stay with you every day, okay?

12:26.920 --> 12:27.880
Okay.

12:29.600 --> 12:31.320
-Okay.
-Mother.

12:35.240 --> 12:36.160
Wait for me.

12:38.840 --> 12:40.240
I'll wait for you.

12:54.080 --> 12:57.160
BERYL STONES JEWELRY DRAWING

13:01.960 --> 13:04.480
Your design is also exquisite.

13:05.000 --> 13:07.480
But it's not as good as Ms. Su's.

13:08.640 --> 13:11.040
For that beryl stones stone,

13:11.600 --> 13:12.760
I would like to sign a contract with you.

13:13.760 --> 13:15.920
Mr. Kang, you made the right choice.

13:16.480 --> 13:17.320
Thank you.

13:17.400 --> 13:19.720
I'll pay the deposit in time.

13:20.240 --> 13:21.520
I look forward to your good news.

13:22.240 --> 13:24.840
Mr. Kang, we'll do our best.

13:26.480 --> 13:30.960
Mr. Zheng, what is it about?

13:31.760 --> 13:32.760
I'll be blunt.

13:32.840 --> 13:34.480
Three years ago,

13:34.560 --> 13:37.080
you spent three million cashes
on two Hus of beryl stones.

13:37.160 --> 13:39.480
I won't let you lose money.

13:39.560 --> 13:41.840
I'll pay you ten 10% more.

13:41.920 --> 13:43.560
That is 3.3 million cashes.

13:44.880 --> 13:46.080
Here's a contract.

14:01.440 --> 14:02.360
Well…

14:04.280 --> 14:05.840
I've sold out

14:06.720 --> 14:07.960
of those beryl stones.

14:13.040 --> 14:14.160
Mr. Sun.

14:14.920 --> 14:16.440
-Mr. Zheng.
-What about you?

14:18.000 --> 14:20.080
I didn't have many of them.

14:22.880 --> 14:23.840
And I've sold them out.

14:23.920 --> 14:25.200
Who did you sell them to?

14:26.280 --> 14:28.120
I sold them to someone
who paid the higher price.

14:33.320 --> 14:34.160
Mr. Zhou.

14:35.200 --> 14:36.840
Have you also sold yours out?

14:47.520 --> 14:49.000
Looks like

14:49.080 --> 14:52.680
you don't want to stay
at the Yangzhou Jewelry Guild.

14:54.960 --> 14:56.840
No, Mr. Zheng.

14:56.920 --> 14:58.720
We didn't think much about it.

14:58.800 --> 15:01.400
The beryl stones had a high price.

15:01.480 --> 15:02.920
Our liquidity was tight.

15:03.000 --> 15:06.040
And we needed money. So, we sold them.

15:06.120 --> 15:07.920
-Right, Mr. Huan?
-Yes.

15:08.000 --> 15:09.040
Right?

15:09.120 --> 15:11.360
-Yes.
-All right.

15:11.440 --> 15:12.480
Forget it.

15:13.120 --> 15:15.320
I'd like to propose another toast. Cheers.

15:17.320 --> 15:18.560
Cheers.

15:18.640 --> 15:20.160
Here's to you, Mr. Zheng.

15:29.640 --> 15:30.760
I didn't expect

15:30.840 --> 15:32.760
you to convince them.

15:32.840 --> 15:34.720
I didn't convince them.

15:35.400 --> 15:38.360
They wanted to earn more money.

15:38.440 --> 15:41.240
We bought them at a high price.
What's there to be happy about?

15:42.560 --> 15:44.040
Forget it.

15:44.800 --> 15:47.360
I want the Zheng family
to buy beryl stones from me.

15:47.880 --> 15:48.720
I got what I wanted.

15:50.880 --> 15:52.520
In that case,

15:53.720 --> 15:55.600
are you against me?

15:55.680 --> 15:56.960
I also have a lot of beryl stones.

16:06.560 --> 16:08.000
We'll see.

16:10.640 --> 16:11.640
Okay.

16:13.800 --> 16:14.880
Don't forget

16:14.960 --> 16:17.200
I bought my beryl stones at a low price.

16:18.200 --> 16:19.200
No matter what price you offer,

16:19.280 --> 16:21.160
I can offer 30% less.

16:22.040 --> 16:23.240
What do you use against me?

16:23.320 --> 16:26.280
The Kang royal family likes Tang's styles.

16:27.600 --> 16:30.400
Clear Mind
is all about styles and production.

16:31.440 --> 16:32.720
As a result,

16:32.800 --> 16:34.840
it makes up for the price loss.

16:36.280 --> 16:37.400
Will you

16:39.280 --> 16:41.200
offer the Zheng family a low price?

16:42.920 --> 16:44.000
I don't think so.

16:44.640 --> 16:46.160
In that case,

16:47.040 --> 16:48.400
you don't have any advantage.

16:59.680 --> 17:00.600
Good for you.

17:01.480 --> 17:02.560
You're becoming

17:03.200 --> 17:04.720
more and more like a businesswoman.

17:11.640 --> 17:13.400
I don't know

17:15.240 --> 17:16.680
what Mr. Zheng is going to do.

17:26.960 --> 17:28.040
Idiot.

17:28.840 --> 17:29.960
I'm sorry, Father.

17:30.640 --> 17:32.600
I didn't expect
the directors to rebel against us.

17:33.320 --> 17:35.080
Those hateful men.

17:35.160 --> 17:38.640
They are against me behind my back.
How dare they!

17:38.720 --> 17:40.640
After this,

17:40.720 --> 17:42.800
I will send people to deal with them
one by one.

17:45.200 --> 17:46.280
Father.

17:46.360 --> 17:48.800
We just signed the contract
with Kang Ming.

17:49.320 --> 17:52.520
We haven't gotten all the beryl stones
he wants yet.

17:52.600 --> 17:54.000
I'm afraid…

17:54.880 --> 17:55.720
What?

17:57.200 --> 17:58.960
We can only buy them at a high price.

18:02.560 --> 18:04.640
-You two, get out.
-Yes, sir.

18:11.720 --> 18:13.640
Wu, you don't know.

18:14.320 --> 18:16.040
The Zheng family is different now.

18:16.120 --> 18:18.040
The Zheng family

18:18.120 --> 18:19.920
lost a lot of money on the Red Leaf Crown.

18:20.000 --> 18:22.880
We can't come up with the money.

18:23.600 --> 18:27.480
When you get to my position,
you'll know my difficulties.

18:33.920 --> 18:36.080
Father. Look.

18:36.720 --> 18:40.080
Can we embezzle

18:40.680 --> 18:42.480
the membership fee?

18:44.680 --> 18:46.920
I'm sorry, Father.
I shouldn't have said that.

18:51.720 --> 18:52.640
I'll think about it.

18:58.400 --> 19:00.880
Master,
Clear Mind's Ms. Su wants to see you.

19:00.960 --> 19:02.920
Su Muzhe.

19:04.840 --> 19:05.800
Why did she come to me?

19:05.880 --> 19:08.200
-I'll stop her.
-No need.

19:09.840 --> 19:12.040
-Send her in.
-Yes, sir.

19:27.120 --> 19:28.360
Mr. Wu.

19:35.640 --> 19:37.880
Mr. Zheng, long time no see.

19:37.960 --> 19:39.360
What do you want to see me about?

19:39.440 --> 19:40.880
I came to congratulate Jubao House

19:40.960 --> 19:43.840
for signing a contract with Mr. Kang.

19:44.840 --> 19:46.640
I heard

19:46.720 --> 19:49.280
that Jubao House needed some beryl stones.

19:50.040 --> 19:53.400
Clear Mind has some.
I'd like to offer them to you.

19:53.480 --> 19:56.360
Su Muzhe, you're buying beryl stones.

19:56.440 --> 19:57.800
Don't say that.

19:57.880 --> 20:00.080
Mr. Zheng is busy.

20:00.160 --> 20:02.240
I want to help him.

20:02.320 --> 20:04.440
You made it sound harsh.

20:04.520 --> 20:07.360
No need.
Jubao House has channels to get them.

20:08.160 --> 20:11.520
Ms. Su,
you bought beryl stones at a high price.

20:11.600 --> 20:14.760
I'm afraid
Clear Mind's liquidity is tight.

20:15.840 --> 20:18.400
Worry about yourself.

20:18.480 --> 20:19.440
You're right.

20:20.280 --> 20:22.760
I thought too much.

20:24.280 --> 20:27.360
Mr. Zheng. I think

20:27.880 --> 20:31.320
only Clear Mind can help you.

20:36.000 --> 20:37.160
Excuse me.

20:38.680 --> 20:40.000
Ms. Su, wait.

20:40.840 --> 20:43.280
Let's sit down and talk.

20:43.880 --> 20:44.800
Ms. Su.

20:46.240 --> 20:47.400
Please.

20:53.880 --> 20:55.960
Wu, serve tea.

20:56.040 --> 20:57.120
Father.

20:57.200 --> 20:59.920
Mr. Wu. Don't make it too hot.

21:00.840 --> 21:02.120
Here, Ms. Su.

21:05.200 --> 21:07.960
The temperature is good. Enjoy it, Ms. Su.

21:09.720 --> 21:10.680
Mr. Wu.

21:17.600 --> 21:22.600
The price of beryl stones
has risen in Yangzhou.

21:22.680 --> 21:26.400
Everyone is expecting it to go up.

21:26.480 --> 21:28.080
But most of the beryl stones

21:28.600 --> 21:31.320
are concentrated in the hands
of a few people.

21:34.280 --> 21:35.160
No, in my hands.

21:36.080 --> 21:37.360
Mr. Kang

21:37.440 --> 21:39.760
bought them from north to south.
But he didn't get many of them.

21:40.360 --> 21:41.560
If you want to buy them from Guangzhou,

21:42.760 --> 21:45.400
it will take you more than a month
to ship them.

21:45.480 --> 21:48.520
If Jubao House can't deliver them in time,

21:50.400 --> 21:52.960
Clear Mind can complete the deal

21:53.040 --> 21:54.160
for Jubao House.

21:55.200 --> 21:56.840
You just reminded me.

21:56.920 --> 21:58.600
Clear Mind's liquidity

21:58.680 --> 22:00.520
is tight.

22:01.240 --> 22:03.680
But our shop is small.

22:03.760 --> 22:06.520
I can get through it
by closing the shop for a month

22:06.600 --> 22:09.960
with those beryl stones in my hands.

22:10.680 --> 22:12.080
I don't need to worry about it.

22:15.920 --> 22:16.880
Ms. Su.

22:18.000 --> 22:19.320
Name your price.

22:26.800 --> 22:28.720
We are jewelry shops in Yangzhou.

22:29.280 --> 22:30.920
We should help each other.

22:31.680 --> 22:33.720
We shouldn't fight each other.

22:35.400 --> 22:38.080
About the price, you think about it.

22:39.440 --> 22:42.120
I believe you will offer me
a satisfactory price.

22:42.960 --> 22:45.600
I'll wait for you at Clear Mind.

22:49.680 --> 22:50.760
Excuse me.

23:11.800 --> 23:13.800
Father.

23:14.520 --> 23:16.320
Although Su Muzhe asked for a high price,

23:16.880 --> 23:18.480
we won't lose everything.

23:18.560 --> 23:20.680
It's better than paying Kang Ming
a huge indemnity.

23:25.360 --> 23:26.560
What's wrong?

23:26.640 --> 23:28.600
I'm sorry, Father.
It slipped out of my hands.

23:28.680 --> 23:30.040
You startled me.

23:30.560 --> 23:32.840
I thought Mr. Zheng was angry.

23:32.920 --> 23:34.280
As long as it's okay.

23:34.360 --> 23:35.840
As long as you're all right.

23:51.720 --> 23:54.360
Shijiu.

23:55.960 --> 23:57.200
Shijiu.

23:58.680 --> 24:01.880
Why did you come back so late?
What did your father say?

24:07.680 --> 24:08.720
Wu.

24:09.960 --> 24:11.080
What did your father say?

24:16.480 --> 24:17.960
The directors

24:18.040 --> 24:19.640
sold the beryl stones to Clear Mind.

24:20.920 --> 24:22.560
My father was furious.

24:22.640 --> 24:24.920
But the delivery date is approaching.
We have to buy them

24:25.560 --> 24:27.240
from Su Muzhe.

24:27.880 --> 24:29.120
It's Su Muzhe again.

24:30.200 --> 24:32.800
I didn't expect to be set up by her.

24:33.480 --> 24:34.800
It doesn't matter.

24:34.880 --> 24:36.600
I don't care about it.

24:41.240 --> 24:44.040
When I finish this batch of beryl stones,
I don't want to do this anymore.

24:44.920 --> 24:46.360
I want to run the Zhenlang Pavilion well.

24:47.400 --> 24:48.440
I'm afraid you can't.

24:53.920 --> 24:54.840
Why?

24:55.640 --> 24:58.680
It's dangerous for us to do this.
We'll be exposed sooner or later.

24:58.760 --> 25:00.000
I know.

25:00.800 --> 25:02.000
Shijiu.

25:04.040 --> 25:05.080
Leave Yangzhou with me.

25:06.560 --> 25:07.400
Leave Yangzhou?

25:07.480 --> 25:09.240
After we deliver this batch
of beryl stones,

25:10.000 --> 25:11.440
let's leave here

25:13.960 --> 25:15.080
with Kang Ming's payment.

25:16.480 --> 25:17.760
Here's the official seal of Jubao House.

25:23.760 --> 25:24.920
Are you crazy?

25:27.680 --> 25:28.760
What happened?

25:31.200 --> 25:32.720
After we complete this deal,

25:34.720 --> 25:36.120
my father will kill you.

25:37.640 --> 25:38.920
You will end up like Lady Huan.

25:39.560 --> 25:42.880
Do you want Zhenlang Pavilion,
or do you want to live?

25:51.920 --> 25:53.480
Garuda is ready.

25:54.360 --> 25:55.200
Shijiu.

25:59.040 --> 26:00.000
Leave with me.

26:04.400 --> 26:06.720
Mr. Wu, there are officers outside.

26:13.000 --> 26:13.960
Hurry.

26:15.400 --> 26:17.320
Hurry. Leave with Lady Shijiu.

26:17.400 --> 26:20.200
Lady Shijiu.

26:20.280 --> 26:22.600
-What's wrong with you? Take her away.
-Lady Shijiu.

26:46.440 --> 26:47.360
Hurry.

26:55.400 --> 26:56.360
There.

26:57.760 --> 26:58.600
Stop.

27:02.360 --> 27:04.480
Go.

27:04.560 --> 27:06.440
No. He's still there.

27:07.040 --> 27:08.240
Mr. Wu asked me

27:08.320 --> 27:10.480
to protect you no matter what happens.

27:10.560 --> 27:13.960
-Let's go.
-No. I want to wait for him.

27:22.400 --> 27:24.320
Zheng Zhiheng, you can't escape.

27:25.320 --> 27:26.160
Chase him.

27:27.480 --> 27:28.640
Don't run.

27:28.720 --> 27:30.800
-Chase him.
-Stop.

27:32.240 --> 27:33.360
Mr. Wu.

27:33.440 --> 27:35.880
Let's go. Go.

27:37.680 --> 27:38.520
Hurry.

27:40.160 --> 27:41.360
Stop.

27:45.120 --> 27:46.440
Garuda.

27:52.080 --> 27:53.320
Garuda.

28:04.880 --> 28:07.640
Take these stolen goods
back to the Grand Governor's Office.

28:07.720 --> 28:09.320
The rest of you, search for them.

28:09.400 --> 28:10.600
Yes, sir.

29:10.520 --> 29:11.680
Sir, no one was in the carriage.

29:11.760 --> 29:15.240
Inspector Zhang ordered us
to close the city gates.

29:15.760 --> 29:18.040
The rest of you, search for them.

29:18.120 --> 29:18.800
-Yes, sir.
-Yes, sir.

29:18.880 --> 29:19.720
-Come with me.
-Yes, sir.

29:19.800 --> 29:20.640
Yes, sir.

29:28.360 --> 29:30.000
WELCOMING PEACE FROM AFAR

29:30.080 --> 29:33.160
SHUNFU TAVERN

29:34.600 --> 29:39.120
CLEAR MIND

29:48.840 --> 29:51.360
Why are you drinking during the day?
What are you thinking about?

29:51.440 --> 29:53.400
Mr. Zhang went to catch them.

29:55.120 --> 29:58.120
What's the point of living
if I can't drink?

29:59.040 --> 30:00.120
Drink tea then.

30:05.680 --> 30:07.320
I'm thirsty.

30:09.840 --> 30:11.600
Did you catch them?

30:13.400 --> 30:14.800
They must still be in the city.

30:16.000 --> 30:18.040
We have to find him
before Zheng Shiyuan does.

30:18.120 --> 30:20.920
What makes you so sure
he will testify against Zheng Shiyuan?

30:21.000 --> 30:23.120
After Zheng Zhixing's death,

30:23.200 --> 30:25.480
Zheng Wu wanted to leave Zheng Shiyuan.

30:26.280 --> 30:27.760
I've sent Kang Ju to search.

30:28.360 --> 30:31.280
But if you need anything,
you can ask Kang Ju.

30:32.160 --> 30:34.040
Okay. I'll ask him if I need him.

30:34.120 --> 30:36.680
Zheng Shiyuan is going

30:37.720 --> 30:39.640
to deliver Kang Ming's order
in a few days.

30:41.600 --> 30:43.520
Zheng Shiyuan is like this now.

30:44.560 --> 30:46.160
I'm afraid he can't deliver it.

30:52.240 --> 30:53.680
Are you thinking about that?

30:56.000 --> 30:57.520
Kang Ming is a businessman.

30:58.120 --> 30:59.440
It's better.

30:59.520 --> 31:02.720
Businessmen talk business.
I can talk to him about business.

31:07.120 --> 31:10.000
You have sold your beryl stones
to Zheng Shiyuan.

31:10.080 --> 31:11.120
What do you do business with him?

31:16.720 --> 31:18.000
Don't play dumb.

31:18.520 --> 31:19.840
You have beryl stones.

31:20.360 --> 31:21.320
Lend them to me.

31:23.040 --> 31:24.400
I can lend them to you.

31:25.320 --> 31:26.720
But I need to ask you for interest.

31:26.800 --> 31:29.120
Interest is not a problem.
I'll pay for her.

31:29.200 --> 31:32.160
What does it have to do with you?
I'm richer than you.

31:33.480 --> 31:36.800
Mr. Yan, you know my economic strength.

31:36.880 --> 31:37.960
Name the price.

31:39.440 --> 31:40.640
Childish.

31:42.760 --> 31:44.880
Since you are so generous,

31:45.480 --> 31:46.520
I'll charge you

31:47.440 --> 31:48.280
ten times the interest.

31:48.360 --> 31:49.440
Ten times?

31:53.400 --> 31:55.960
I have two gold leaves in my book.

31:57.120 --> 31:58.440
I think a gold leaf
is worth a hundred times the interest.

32:01.200 --> 32:03.040
Thank you for your gold leaf, Mr. Zhang.

32:03.120 --> 32:04.080
You're welcome.

32:28.640 --> 32:29.680
Okay.

32:43.080 --> 32:45.720
Get down. Get down.

32:55.720 --> 32:57.560
There's somebody out there.

32:57.640 --> 32:58.680
-Garuda was arrested.
-Go over there.

32:58.760 --> 32:59.800
-What do we do?
-Search.

32:59.880 --> 33:01.080
Why are there so many officers
all of a sudden?

33:07.920 --> 33:09.200
What do we do?

33:09.280 --> 33:10.120
-Shijiu.
-What do we do?

33:10.200 --> 33:12.800
Shijiu. Listen to me. It's safe here.

33:14.320 --> 33:15.680
Let's take a rest here.

33:16.400 --> 33:17.840
You can go back

33:17.920 --> 33:19.680
in the evening.

33:23.120 --> 33:24.120
Where do I go back?

33:25.160 --> 33:26.280
I can't go back.

33:27.240 --> 33:28.800
When I go out, I'm bound to get caught.

33:29.400 --> 33:30.560
-I can't go back.
-No.

33:30.640 --> 33:32.000
You can go back.

33:32.520 --> 33:34.840
After dark, you go to Zhang Jinran

33:34.920 --> 33:37.320
and blame me for everything.

33:37.400 --> 33:40.000
Tell him you don't know anything.

33:40.080 --> 33:42.400
You'll be fine. He'll believe you.

33:48.000 --> 33:49.720
I took the beryl stones down.

33:49.800 --> 33:51.120
I signed the contract.

33:51.200 --> 33:54.480
Even if I can put the blame on you,
will your father

33:54.560 --> 33:55.600
leave me alone?

33:57.240 --> 33:58.880
I have nowhere to go.

34:17.320 --> 34:18.239
There's another way.

34:20.080 --> 34:21.920
We'll leave Yangzhou.

34:22.440 --> 34:23.360
How?

34:24.440 --> 34:25.360
Right.

34:26.040 --> 34:27.600
City gates can only be closed
for up to three days.

34:28.520 --> 34:32.280
If we can get away with it for three days,

34:32.360 --> 34:35.400
we'll pick up my other

34:35.480 --> 34:38.000
and take beryl stones to leave Yangzhou.

34:39.360 --> 34:40.760
Yeah, we still have a chance.

34:42.320 --> 34:43.159
Do you want to give it a try?

34:46.199 --> 34:47.159
GRAND GOVERNOR'S OFFICE

34:47.239 --> 34:48.400
Zhang Jinran.

34:49.199 --> 34:50.880
Where is Zhang Jinran? Get out of here.

34:50.960 --> 34:51.960
VIRTUE SURPASSES MATERIAL TREASURE

34:52.040 --> 34:54.000
Who asked you to close the city gates?

34:54.080 --> 34:57.320
It's outrageous. I'll impeach you.

34:57.400 --> 34:58.560
Mr. Wang.

34:59.320 --> 35:02.280
I'm the Inspector of Huainandao.
I have the right to make decisions.

35:02.360 --> 35:04.080
But you can't ignore the people.

35:04.160 --> 35:05.760
How can people do business and live

35:05.840 --> 35:07.120
when you close the city gates?

35:07.760 --> 35:11.520
Why are you going through all this trouble
to catch Zheng Wu?

35:11.600 --> 35:13.080
Mr. Wang.

35:14.200 --> 35:15.440
Zheng Wu harbors and sells stolen goods.

35:15.520 --> 35:17.520
The stolen goods are in his mansion.

35:18.040 --> 35:20.080
I have to arrest him.

35:20.960 --> 35:22.360
Impeach me as you will.

35:23.440 --> 35:25.360
I have work to do. Excuse me.

35:36.200 --> 35:40.280
Master, please save Wu.

35:40.360 --> 35:41.560
Master.

35:43.040 --> 35:45.280
The whole city is on lockdown
to catch him.

35:45.360 --> 35:46.480
How can I save him?

35:46.560 --> 35:47.720
What can I do to save him?

35:47.800 --> 35:51.800
He's my only son.

35:52.680 --> 35:53.880
What a cheek.

35:53.960 --> 35:55.480
Your son

35:55.560 --> 35:58.600
betrayed me and the Zheng family
for a woman.

35:58.680 --> 36:00.400
I wish I could kill him myself.

36:00.480 --> 36:02.520
You can't do that.

36:02.600 --> 36:04.680
He's your son, too.

36:05.200 --> 36:08.000
He's also your only son.

36:08.080 --> 36:10.120
-Stop crying.
-Master.

36:10.200 --> 36:11.480
What is it?

36:12.800 --> 36:14.480
Master, here's a letter for you.

36:17.040 --> 36:18.560
-Is it Wu?
-Get out of here.

36:23.320 --> 36:26.000
I'M COMING TO YOU. DON'T ACT RASHLY

36:28.280 --> 36:30.520
Master, there's one more thing.

36:31.040 --> 36:33.360
Su Muzhe is here.

36:34.360 --> 36:36.560
-Su Muzhe?
-Yes.

36:41.040 --> 36:42.400
Master.

36:47.640 --> 36:49.320
Wu.

36:50.840 --> 36:53.600
My dear son.

36:53.680 --> 36:56.120
Master, slow down.

37:04.400 --> 37:05.920
-Get out.
-Yes, sir.

37:07.400 --> 37:08.400
Su Muzhe.

37:09.160 --> 37:10.000
What are you doing here?

37:15.400 --> 37:18.480
Drop the act. What do you want to say?

37:21.760 --> 37:22.960
I heard

37:24.080 --> 37:26.160
Jubao House can't deliver the beryl stones

37:26.240 --> 37:28.720
Mr. Kang ordered.

37:29.240 --> 37:30.080
I'm here to help you.

37:31.360 --> 37:33.920
Do you want me to thank you?

37:34.000 --> 37:35.000
No need.

37:35.080 --> 37:36.680
However,

37:37.440 --> 37:40.120
it took me a lot of effort

37:41.560 --> 37:42.960
to deliver them.

37:47.560 --> 37:49.000
Ms. Su, what are you doing?

37:52.440 --> 37:54.200
Jubao House
can't deliver the beryl stones.

37:54.280 --> 37:55.840
I want to deliver them for him.

37:57.080 --> 38:01.080
Mr. Kang,
please transfer the contract to me.

38:02.840 --> 38:05.160
The Zheng family
can't deliver the beryl stones.

38:07.000 --> 38:08.440
It's a hot potato.

38:08.520 --> 38:11.560
If you push them hard, I'm afraid…

38:11.640 --> 38:15.080
I'll consume them.

38:15.680 --> 38:18.600
As your friend, I have to remind you
that it's dangerous.

38:19.720 --> 38:21.040
But as a businessman,

38:21.680 --> 38:25.000
it's hard for me to refuse your request.

38:34.080 --> 38:36.640
Jubao House
couldn't deliver the beryl stones.

38:37.760 --> 38:39.400
Clear Mind delivered them for you.

38:41.120 --> 38:43.600
In other words, from this day forward,

38:43.680 --> 38:45.280
I am your creditor.

38:48.400 --> 38:49.360
CLEAR MIND HAS DELIVERED THE BERYL STONES
TO KANG MING

38:49.440 --> 38:50.400
THE BERYL STONES JUBAO HOUSE
FAILED TO DELIVER

38:50.480 --> 38:51.440
WILL BE RECOVERED
BY SU MUZHE OF CLEAR MIND

38:54.440 --> 38:57.320
Mr. Zheng, you're so rude.
You tore up the contract.

38:57.400 --> 38:59.600
I'm telling you.
The government has a copy of the contract.

38:59.680 --> 39:00.960
It's useless for you to tear it off.

39:01.040 --> 39:04.200
Mr. Zheng, you didn't pay us back,
and you tore off the contract.

39:04.280 --> 39:06.720
No one in Yangzhou
will cooperate with you anymore.

39:06.800 --> 39:09.120
Su Muzhe. I don't care if my creditor
is you or Kang Ming.

39:09.200 --> 39:11.720
I signed the contract.
I'll deliver the goods.

39:11.800 --> 39:13.840
Tomorrow is delivery day.

39:16.120 --> 39:17.440
If you can't deliver the goods tomorrow,

39:17.520 --> 39:18.840
you'll have to pay
three times the compensation.

39:18.920 --> 39:20.080
Three times.

39:20.800 --> 39:21.640
Three times.

39:21.720 --> 39:23.160
I can accept it.

39:25.560 --> 39:26.400
Ms. Su.

39:28.720 --> 39:29.960
Ms. Su.

39:32.920 --> 39:35.600
-What do you want?
-It's not what I want.

39:37.320 --> 39:39.400
It's what you owe me

39:39.480 --> 39:40.560
for what you've done all these years.

39:43.480 --> 39:45.640
Jubao House has give shops in Yangzhou.

39:46.720 --> 39:48.320
I'll ask you

39:49.800 --> 39:51.040
for three shops.

39:52.320 --> 39:53.200
It's not too much.

39:54.080 --> 39:56.080
-Su Muzhe, you…
-Excuse me.

40:01.520 --> 40:04.120
Ms. Su.

40:09.040 --> 40:10.240
Have you seen this person?

40:10.320 --> 40:11.160
-Have you seen this person?
-No.

40:11.240 --> 40:12.280
Have you seen this person?

40:13.800 --> 40:15.320
-Have you seen this person?
-Have you seen this person?

40:15.400 --> 40:16.240
No.

40:16.320 --> 40:17.280
-Have you seen this person?
-Have you seen this person?

40:17.360 --> 40:18.680
-Have you seen this person?
-No.

40:19.480 --> 40:20.320
I haven't seen him, sir.

40:21.120 --> 40:22.720
-Have you seen this person?
-No.

40:22.800 --> 40:25.000
-Have you seen this person?
-No.

40:30.160 --> 40:31.520
-Open the door.
-Open the door.

40:31.600 --> 40:33.240
-Who is it?
-Open the door.

40:33.320 --> 40:34.680
-Search.
-Out of the way.

40:35.360 --> 40:36.840
-Open the door. Hurry.
-Open the door.

40:36.920 --> 40:37.760
-Open the door.
-Hurry.

40:37.840 --> 40:38.920
-Search.
-Search.

40:39.000 --> 40:39.960
Open the door.

40:40.920 --> 40:41.840
Out of the way.

40:41.920 --> 40:43.040
Search.

40:45.360 --> 40:46.400
Go.

40:51.200 --> 40:52.560
SHUNFU TAVERN

41:05.880 --> 41:07.360
Shijiu, there's someone outside.

41:08.080 --> 41:10.040
-You guys. This way.
-Yes, sir.

41:10.920 --> 41:12.040
You guys. Go over there.

41:12.120 --> 41:13.160
Yes, sir.

41:22.840 --> 41:25.080
Wu, open the door.

41:25.160 --> 41:26.480
What?

41:27.320 --> 41:28.360
Okay.

41:31.680 --> 41:33.360
-Keep searching.
-Yes, sir.

41:50.960 --> 41:51.960
Search carefully.

41:55.840 --> 41:56.760
Search carefully.

42:08.120 --> 42:09.000
Go.

42:14.760 --> 42:17.080
-Let's go.
-They are not here. Go there.

42:34.720 --> 42:36.280
Officers have just searched here.

42:36.800 --> 42:39.560
We're safe here for the time being.

42:42.880 --> 42:44.320
When we get out of Yangzhou,

42:44.920 --> 42:46.640
everything will be fine.

42:52.320 --> 42:55.120
What are you smiling?

42:55.760 --> 42:57.560
When it comes to having fun,

42:57.640 --> 42:59.800
you are the best in Yangzhou.

43:01.160 --> 43:02.720
Why are you lying here with me now?

43:04.120 --> 43:06.320
That's because I like…

43:08.240 --> 43:10.640
That's because I like to meddle.

43:13.400 --> 43:15.760
Okay. Stay out of this.

43:15.840 --> 43:16.920
Next time the officers come,

43:17.520 --> 43:20.440
you hand me over.
So, you can still be Zheng Wu.

43:22.160 --> 43:26.280
Okay. Next time the officers come,
you open the door for them.

43:34.760 --> 43:35.880
They are not here.

43:35.960 --> 43:37.680
-Search carefully.
-Yes, sir.
